  "id": "exchange-relationship",
  "term": "exchange relationship",
  "definition": "An exchange relationship is the employee’s experienced working relationship with a supervisor, often discussed as leader-member exchange (LMX). In this context, it is viewed as a resource that can shape how job conditions relate to well-being, such as job satisfaction and emotional exhaustion.",
